{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：检测到新的Okta认证行为。对应需求：初始访问。官方：New Okta Authentication Behavior Detected。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-okta.system-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：检测到新的Okta认证行为","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：检测到新的Okta认证行为\n\n### 为何重要\n首次进入主机或服务\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/testing-okta-visibility-and-detection-dorothy","https://sec.okta.com/articles/2023/08/cross-tenant-impersonation-prevention-and-detection","https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/muddled-libra/","https://help.okta.com/oie/en-us/content/topics/security/behavior-detection/about-behavior-detection.htm","https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/monitoring-okta-threats-with-elastic-security","https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/starter-guide-to-understanding-okta"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"260486ee-7d98-11ee-9599-f661ea17fbcd","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: 跨平台","主题: 初始访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 初始访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"event.dataset:okta.system and okta.debug_context.debug_data.risk_behaviors:*\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1078.004","name":"Cloud Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"okta","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud.account.id","process.